# Project Vision

Project Axiom is an Open Source Enterprise Foundation Platform.

It is **NOT** an ERP.

It is a reusable platform capable of building ERPs for multiple industries without redesigning the platform.

Example Domains

- Sugar Industry
- Manufacturing
- Retail
- Jewellery
- Hospital
- Dairy
- Logistics
- Warehouse
- Agriculture
- Government

