# New Architectural Decisions

## Platform Philosophy

Project Axiom is a Platform.

Applications are built on top of it.

Applications must never define the platform.

---

## Platform Layers

Platform Core

↓

Business Engines

↓

Domain Applications

---

## Enterprise Meta Model (Draft)

The platform will initially be designed around the following universal concepts:

- Organization
- Person
- Business Partner
- User
- Role
- Permission
- Asset
- Product
- Service
- Inventory
- Transaction
- Document
- Workflow
- Payment
- Notification
- Report
- Audit
- Configuration
- Attachment
- Location

This list may evolve during Sprint 1.

---

# Major Discovery

The platform should **NOT** use industry-specific entities internally.

Instead of:

- Farmer
- Tractor
- Sugar Factory

The platform should use:

- Business Partner
- Asset
- Organization

Industry modules will extend these generic concepts.

